-- a.talk: the join-early-failures case's Script. Its Join is preempted
-- after starting both members, which then fail in reverse order.

on go
  try
    wait for all
      ask stock to check "A1" and wait
      ask stock to check "B2" and wait
    end wait
  catch {code: c, index: i}
    return [c, i]
  end try
end go
